{"4698890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seyrfall Online", "steam_appid": 4698890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras/5545c4e1e6d13907b1a38f68256e0bad.avif?t=1785313725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras_big/5545c4e1e6d13907b1a38f68256e0bad.webp?t=1785313725 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World Built for Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras/41adae2be2f9d12c88f5e215069a22f6.avif?t=1785313725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras_big/41adae2be2f9d12c88f5e215069a22f6.webp?t=1785313725 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seyrfall Online is a dark fantasy 2D action RPG shaped around exploration and discovery<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras/fdcb3545562ade5561d66f940db87299.avif?t=1785313725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras_big/fdcb3545562ade5561d66f940db87299.webp?t=1785313725 width=1560 height=731 /></span><br>Long-term character progression. The world gives players greater freedom to choose where they travel, what challenges they pursue, and how they develop their characters.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras/d4cd2593c97b6e61c62700928c2967d8.avif?t=1785313725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras_big/d4cd2593c97b6e61c62700928c2967d8.webp?t=1785313725 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot rare items, craft and customize your gear, follow an epic questline, and shape your character with unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras/af0236484b4a9e9d599ae4b9bc86378e.avif?t=1785313725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras_big/af0236484b4a9e9d599ae4b9bc86378e.webp?t=1785313725 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with other players, battle together, and build your adventure as a group. Create or join a guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras/5545c4e1e6d13907b1a38f68256e0bad.avif?t=1785313725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras_big/5545c4e1e6d13907b1a38f68256e0bad.webp?t=1785313725 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World Built for Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras/41adae2be2f9d12c88f5e215069a22f6.avif?t=1785313725\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4698890/extras_big/41adae2be2f9d12c88f5e215069a22f6.webp?t=1785313725 width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seyrfall Online is a dark fantasy 2D action RPG shaped around exploration and discovery<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/469